Methods
Datasets
We downloaded mRNA expressions, genomic mutations, reverse phase protein array (RPPA) expressions, and metabolomics data from CCLE, and copy number variations (CNV) and half maximal inhibitory concentration (IC50) of drug responses from GDSC, and interactome data from HINT
1
(High-quality INTeractomes) database. The details of the datasets used in the experiments are summarized in Table
8
.
